{"version":1,"content":"<p>本地中菜一向蓬勃發展，近日有多間內地名店大廚到港，和本地的酒店和餐廳合作推出聯乘美食，可即時品嘗各地菜系，此外，部分餐廳亦有應季主題，打造出精緻中菜。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;福建珍味&lt;br/&gt;沙田五星級酒店高</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.232432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.942657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.942657+00:00","content_hash":"f9ecff559e46722f79709dc53292674ae0e12b6a20c84aa8395744f20ff06810","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}